{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油麻地有住宅單位起火無人受傷，10多人疏散。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">起火住宅單位位於廟街148號，消防射水灌救。昨晚十時許，警方接報指上址有單位冒煙，消防員到場迅速將火救熄，初步調查涉事單位有電池起火，導致火警，十多人自行疏散。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YMT-0130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026BuUFtln0uf1784498564.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.YMT-0130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">火警期間，鄰近一段北海街一度被封鎖。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T22:17:57.873582+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}